AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmsk9yb97046zrow93i345be7","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsk9yb97046zrow93i345be7","published_at":"2026-08-08T11:05:50Z","ref":"A4","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","summary":"Google DeepMind 与 Google Research 开发的 AI 模型 WeatherNext，在 2025 年 10 月飓风 Melissa 登陆前 5 天，以 80% 的置信度预测其将以 5 级飓风强度袭击牙买加。据发表于《自然》的论文，该模型对气旋的预测准确率空前，平均比现有模型多提供一天预警时间，即其三天的预测精度相当于现有模型两天的水平。","title":"DeepMind 的 WeatherNext 飓风模型为预报员争取到额外一天预警时间","title_en":"DeepMind's hurricane model bought forecasters an extra day","url":"https://arstechnica.com/science/2026/08/deepminds-hurricane-model-bought-forecasters-an-extra-day"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsk5m3kq0ahqro4bn4nh1r6r","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmsk5m3kq0ahqro4bn4nh1r6r","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsk5m3kq0ahqro4bn4nh1r6r","published_at":"2026-08-08T08:25:11Z","ref":"A5","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家（RSS）","summary":"苹果官网 Mac 简体中文使用手册新增《在 Mac 上配合 Apple 智能使用千问》支持文档，明确 Apple 智能可配合阿里巴巴千问模型工作。千问扩展适用于 macOS 26.6 或更高版本，需中国大陆 Apple 账户及机型，支持写作工具与 Siri，用户需登录千问账户使用。","title":"苹果 Mac 简体中文支持文档更新，\"Apple 智能\"阿里千问扩展现身","title_en":"苹果 Mac 简体中文支持文档更新，\"Apple 智能\"阿里千问扩展现身了","url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/987/366.htm"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsjk6eiz0byoroo5cc4bcwg6","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmsjk6eiz0byoroo5cc4bcwg6","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmsjk6eiz0byoroo5cc4bcwg6","published_at":"2026-08-07T23:08:56Z","ref":"A6","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"IT之家（RSS）","summary":"OpenAI 因内部与专家评估显示 Astra 在智能体编程和网络安全领域取得重大突破，依据《准备框架》将其列为旗下首个网络安全风险达\"关键\"级别的模型，决定延缓发布。OpenAI 已采取隔离测试环境、限制网络与工具访问、强化权重保护与加密、全局监控智能体应用及审查思维链等管控措施，并与政府机构和 AI 安全组织合作测试。CEO 萨姆·奥尔特曼表示 Astra 性能强劲，正全力推进公开发布。","title":"OpenAI：因网络安全风险，延缓 Astra 模型发布","title_en":null,"url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/987/221.htm"}],"counts":{"aihot_published":6,"aihot_upstream":6,"tre